        move('the Sifrei 75:2 (two teachers on the callee — R. Yehuda, Rabbi)', "the pointer row 12:20 — RUN_CITATION of erection.repeats' Exodus 34:24 clause; the row's field %r" % ([r for r in READBACK if r['verses'] == 'Deut 12:20'][0]['pointer'],))
